{"title":"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Problems from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Shortlist\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO Shortlist\">IMO Shortlist</a> 1973:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Bulgaria_1\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Bulgaria 1\"> Bulgaria 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Czechoslovakia_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Czechoslovakia 1 (page does not exist)\"> Czechoslovakia 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Czechoslovakia_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Czechoslovakia 2 (page does not exist)\"> Czechoslovakia 2</a> (first question on the IMO)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Cuba_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Cuba 1 (page does not exist)\"> Cuba 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Cuba_2\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Cuba 2\"> Cuba 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/France_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/France 1 (page does not exist)\"> France 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Great_Britain_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Great Britain 1 (page does not exist)\"> Great Britain 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Poland_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Poland 1 (page does not exist)\"> Poland 1</a> (second question on the IMO)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Poland_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Poland 2 (page does not exist)\"> Poland 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Poland_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Poland 3 (page does not exist)\"> Poland 3</a> (fifth question on the IMO)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Romania_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Romania 1 (page does not exist)\"> Romania 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Romania_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Romania 2 (page does not exist)\"> Romania 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Sweden_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Sweden 1 (page does not exist)\"> Sweden 1</a> (sixth question on the IMO)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Sweden_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Sweden 2 (page does not exist)\"> Sweden 2</a> (third question on the IMO)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Sweden_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Sweden 3 (page does not exist)\"> Sweden 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Yugoslavia_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Yugoslavia 1 (page does not exist)\"> Yugoslavia 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/Yugoslavia_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 IMO Shortlist Problems/Yugoslavia 2 (page does not exist)\"> Yugoslavia 2</a> (fourth question on the IMO)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</